    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "138a6e41-f23e-80a6-af5a-d78d015646f7",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "138a6e41-f23e-8041-a385-d861f5575df7"
      },
      "created_time": "2024-11-08T08:06:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2024-11-08T08:06:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "numbered_list_item",
      "numbered_list_item": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Angel investing: Beyond just covering their living expenses, it would be good for successful charitable leaders to directly fund the next round of charities; retroactive payments for impactful work could enable this",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Angel investing: Beyond just covering their living expenses, it would be good for successful charitable leaders to directly fund the next round of charities; retroactive payments for impactful work could enable this",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "138a6e41-f23e-805f-ac22-fb099bbb84bd",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "138a6e41-f23e-8041-a385-d861f5575df7"
      },
      "created_time": "2024-11-08T08:06:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2024-11-08T08:06:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "One thing that makes Silicon Valley work is that successful exited startup founders can then invest in seed rounds of new startups. Exited founders are in a very good position to assess whether a new startup is any good; it's a shame this doesn't happen in nonprofit-land, as a creator of a very successful charity does not then have millions in discretionary funds to fund new charities (absent retroactive payments)",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "One thing that makes Silicon Valley work is that successful exited startup founders can then invest in seed rounds of new startups. Exited founders are in a very good position to assess whether a new startup is any good; it's a shame this doesn't happen in nonprofit-land, as a creator of a very successful charity does not then have millions in discretionary funds to fund new charities (absent retroactive payments)",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "138a6e41-f23e-8018-8371-d147abfaa435",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "138a6e41-f23e-8041-a385-d861f5575df7"
      },
      "created_time": "2024-11-08T08:06:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2024-11-08T08:06:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "numbered_list_item",
      "numbered_list_item": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Prospective funding proposals mean grantees kind of have to hold impact hostage, and that",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Prospective funding proposals mean grantees kind of have to hold impact hostage, and that",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "138a6e41-f23e-804d-ab8c-f8529faa7fa4",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "138a6e41-f23e-8041-a385-d861f5575df7"
      },
      "created_time": "2024-11-08T08:06:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2024-11-08T08:06:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Maybe this is just me, but I kind of hate writing a funding proposal. It feels like I'm holding my impact as a hostage - \"look at that nice impact in front of you, sure would be a shame if something were to happen to it\"",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Maybe this is just me, but I kind of hate writing a funding proposal. It feels like I'm holding my impact as a hostage - \"look at that nice impact in front of you, sure would be a shame if something were to happen to it\"",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "138a6e41-f23e-80c2-9f59-ef48e66456bf",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "138a6e41-f23e-8041-a385-d861f5575df7"
      },
      "created_time": "2024-11-08T08:06:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2024-11-08T08:06:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Examples of retroactive donations I'm proud of making:\n$10k to VaccinateCA\n$10k to Michael Trazzi for salary and costs incurred while filming an SB 1047 documentary",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Examples of retroactive donations I'm proud of making:\n$10k to VaccinateCA\n$10k to Michael Trazzi for salary and costs incurred while filming an SB 1047 documentary",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
